<view class="page"><navigation-bar title="照片整理助手" back="{{false}}" background="#ffffff" color="#1f2329"></navigation-bar><scroll-view class="body" scroll-y show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="wrap" wx:if="{{ready}}"><view class="hero"><view class="hero-head"><view><text class="eyebrow">AI PHOTO ORGANIZER</text><text class="hero-title">让每张照片都找到位置</text><text class="hero-sub">选择相邻照片后，我们用定位地图帮你找出重复内容</text></view><text class="hero-mark">✦</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="choosePhotos" loading="{{importing}}">{{importing ? '正在分析…' : '选择照片开始整理'}}</button><text class="privacy">每次最多选择 9 张；尽量选择相邻照片，定位地图会按选择顺序标记位置</text></view><view class="metrics"><view><text class="metric-v">{{stats.total}}</text><text class="metric-l">已分析照片</text></view><view><text class="metric-v">{{stats.duplicateGroups}}</text><text class="metric-l">重复分组</text></view><view><text class="metric-v">{{stats.reclaimText}}</text><text class="metric-l">可整理空间</text></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">整理任务</text><text class="section-link" bindtap="goDuplicates">查看全部 ›</text></view><view class="task-card" bindtap="goDuplicates"><view class="task-icon">⧉</view><view class="flex-1"><text class="task-title">重复照片</text><text class="task-sub">发现 {{stats.duplicatePhotos}} 张可进一步确认</text></view><text class="task-arrow">›</text></view><view class="task-card" bindtap="goLibrary"><view class="task-icon blue">▦</view><view class="flex-1"><text class="task-title">照片库</text><text class="task-sub">共 {{stats.total}} 张，已占用 {{stats.totalBytesText}}</text></view><text class="task-arrow">›</text></view></view><view class="section" wx:if="{{recent.length}}"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">最近导入</text></view><scroll-view class="photo-strip" scroll-x show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="thumb-wrap" wx:for="{{recent}}" wx:key="id"><image class="thumb" src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><text class="thumb-status" style="color:{{item.reviewMeta.color}};background:{{item.reviewMeta.bg}}">{{item.reviewMeta.label}}</text></view></scroll-view></view><view class="notice">当前版本先在本地完成重复检测。AI 标签和精选建议会通过后续云函数接入；小程序不会直接删除手机相册原图。</view><view class="danger-link" bindtap="clearReview" wx:if="{{stats.total}}">清空本地分析记录</view><view class="safe-space"></view></view></scroll-view></view>

